    <VI_Package_Configuration_File>Viviota ORM - Direct Connections.vipc</VI_Package_Configuration_File>
    <Description>
      <One_Line_Description_Summary>Extension to ORM library for Direct dll connections rather than .NET Core</One_Line_Description_Summary>
      <Description>This library extends the Viviota ORM library to allow for direct dll connections rather than the .NET Standard plugins originally used.

This uses the JDP database libraries under the hood found here:
https://www.vipm.io/package/jdp_science_postgresql/
https://www.vipm.io/package/drjdpowell_lib_sqlite_labview/

While this library is distributed in PPLs (with debug versions included), the JDP versions are linked as dependencies for lincensing requirements.

NOTE: This library is provided in a compiled format utilyzing PPLs, a set of the "debug" PPLs are included as well and can be found in the installation directory.</Description>
      <Copyright/>
      <Packager>Viviota</Packager>
      <URL/>
      <Release_Notes>Initial Distribution</Release_Notes>
    </Description>
